 * Per-server / per-node bearer tokens for the nxeon-shipper live-telemetry
 * agent (see agent/nxeon-shipper). Unlike lib/terminal-token.ts (a 60s JWE
 * minted per browser session), a shipper token is a PERSISTENT machine
 * credential baked into cloud-init / a node's shipper config at provision
 * time and used indefinitely from then on — so it follows the same
